msgid "WebXR"
msgstr "WebXR"

msgid ""
"WebXR is a web standard for delivering XR experiences right from a web "
"browser, without the user needing to install anything. Godot has built-in "
"support for WebXR."
msgstr ""
"WebXR 是一项 Web 标准，允许用户直接通过浏览器体验 XR 应用，无需安装任何软件。"
"Godot 已内置对 WebXR 的支持。"

msgid ""
"As this uses the HTML export WebXR requires the use of the compatibility "
"renderer. Godot currently requires multiview support for stereo rendering "
"which is not available on all WebXR capable devices."
msgstr ""
"由于此操作涉及 HTML 导出功能，WebXR 需要使用兼容性渲染器。Godot 目前要求支持"
"多视图立体渲染，而这一功能并非所有支持 WebXR 的设备都具备。"

msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

msgid ""
"Setting up WebXR is a little different because your application always "
"starts as a normal non-XR webpage. We thus define a 2D UI on our main page "
"that includes a button that will switch to XR."
msgstr ""
"WebXR 的设置略有不同，因为您的应用程序始终以常规的非 XR 网页形式启动。因此，"
"我们在主页面上定义了一个 2D 用户界面，其中包含一个可切换至 XR 模式的按钮。"

msgid "We will need the following code to make things work:"
msgstr "我们需要以下代码来使系统正常运行："

msgid ""
"Make sure the \"Enable WebXR\" button's ``button_pressed`` signal calls the "
"``_on_enter_webxr_button_pressed`` method."
msgstr ""
"确保“启用 WebXR”按钮的 ``button_pressed`` 信号调用了 "
"``_on_enter_webxr_button_pressed`` 方法。"

msgid ""
"In the code above we attempt to use the ``local-floor`` reference spaces. "
"This reference spaces assumes gameplay where we need to know the player's "
"height from the floor."
msgstr ""
"在上述代码中，我们尝试使用 ``local-floor`` 参考空间。该参考空间适用于需要获取"
"玩家距地面高度的游戏场景。"

msgid ""
"For games where the player is seated inside of a vehicle, such as flight "
"sims or racing games, the reference space ``local`` may be more appropriate."
msgstr ""
"对于玩家 seated 在车辆内的游戏（例如飞行模拟游戏或赛车游戏），使用参考空间 "
"``local`` 可能更为合适。"

msgid "Controller input"
msgstr "控制器输入"

msgid ""
"The input system in WebXR works against a fixed set of inputs that obfuscate "
"the actual hardware being used. In order to allow for code to be portable "
"between a WebXR and OpenXR application these inputs are mapped to actions "
"that overlap with the default action map used by our OpenXR interface."
msgstr ""
"WebXR 的输入系统基于一组固定的输入接口，这些接口用于掩盖实际使用的硬件设备。"
"为实现 WebXR 与 OpenXR 应用程序之间的代码可移植性，这些输入接口被映射到与我"
"们 OpenXR 界面所使用的默认操作映射相重叠的操作上。"

msgid ""
"There are small differences such as WebXR separating touchpad and "
"thumbsticks as separate inputs, instead of the primary and secondary input "
"setup found in our default OpenXR action map."
msgstr ""
"存在一些细微差异，例如 WebXR 将触控板与拇指摇杆作为独立输入设备进行区分，而非"
"采用我们在默认 OpenXR 操作映射中所采用的“主/次输入”设置。"

msgid "The core inputs are available for WebXR:"
msgstr "核心输入接口适用于 WebXR："

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

msgid "trigger_click"
msgstr "trigger_click"

msgid "Boolean"
msgstr "Boolean"

msgid "``true`` if the trigger is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 若触发器被按下"

msgid "trigger"
msgstr "trigger"

msgid "Float"
msgstr "浮点数"

msgid "Trigger value between 0.0 and 1.0"
msgstr "触发值范围为 0.0 至 1.0"

msgid "grip_click"
msgstr "grip_click"

msgid "``true`` if the grip button is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 若按下握把按钮"

msgid "grip"
msgstr "grip"

msgid "Grip value between 0.0 and 1.0"
msgstr "抓握值范围为 0.0 至 1.0"

msgid "touchpad_click"
msgstr "touchpad_click"

msgid "``true`` if the touchpad is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 若触摸板被按下"

msgid "thumbstick_click"
msgstr "thumbstick_click"

msgid "``true`` if the thumbstick is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 若拇指摇杆被按下"

msgid "ax_button"
msgstr "ax_button"

msgid "``true`` if the A or X button is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 当按下 A 或 X 按键时"

msgid "by_button"
msgstr "by_button"

msgid "``true`` if the B or Y button is pressed"
msgstr "``true`` 若按下 B 或 Y 按钮"

msgid "touchpad_x"
msgstr "touchpad_x"

msgid "Finger movement on the touchpad in the X direction"
msgstr "在触摸板上进行向X轴方向的手指移动"

