msgstr "触控板输入（以 Vector2 形式）"

msgid "thumbstick_x"
msgstr "thumbstick_x"

msgid "Thumbstick movement in the X direction"
msgstr "拇指摇杆沿X轴方向移动"

msgid "thumbstick_y"
msgstr "thumbstick_y"

msgid "Thumbstick movement in the Y direction"
msgstr "拇指摇杆沿Y轴方向移动"

msgid "thumbstick"
msgstr "thumbstick"

msgid "Thumbstick input as a Vector2"
msgstr "拇指摇杆输入（以 Vector2 形式）"

msgid ""
"WebXR also exposes ``aim`` and ``grip`` poses that respectively identify a "
"forward facing location at the tip of the controller and a position on the "
"controller grip."
msgstr ""
"WebXR 还提供了 ``aim`` 和 ``grip`` 两种姿态数据，分别用于标识控制器尖端处的正"
"前方位置以及控制器握把上的位置。"
